#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/route_redistributions.rst:4
msgid "Route Redistribution"
msgstr "Route Redistribution"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/route_redistributions.rst:6
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure > Network > Routers > (select Router) > Route "
"Redistribution``"
msgstr "``Infrastructure > Network > Routers > (select Router) > Route Redistribution``"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/route_redistributions.rst:9
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Übersicht"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/route_redistributions.rst:11
msgid ""
"Route redistribution allows routes learned through one routing protocol "
"to be advertised via another. This is essential in environments that run "
"multiple routing protocols (e.g., redistributing static routes or OSPF "
"routes into BGP). |morpheus| supports managing route redistribution "
"configurations on router types that expose this capability."
msgstr "Route Redistribution ermöglicht, dass über ein Routing-Protokoll gelernte Routen über ein anderes beworben werden. Dies ist in Umgebungen mit mehreren Routing-Protokollen essenziell (z. B. Redistribution statischer Routen oder OSPF-Routen in BGP). |morpheus| unterstützt die Verwaltung von Route-Redistribution-Konfigurationen auf Router-Typen, die diese Fähigkeit bereitstellen."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/route_redistributions.rst:13
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/route_redistributions.rst:32
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Hinweis"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/route_redistributions.rst:13
msgid ""
"The Route Redistribution tab is available on router types that support "
"redistribution (``hasRouteRedistribution`` flag). NSX Edge Gateways are "
"the primary router type with route redistribution support in |morpheus|."
msgstr "Die Registerkarte Route Redistribution ist auf Router-Typen verfügbar, die Redistribution unterstützen (Flag ``hasRouteRedistribution``). NSX Edge Gateways sind der primäre Router-Typ mit Route-Redistribution-Unterstützung in |morpheus|."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/route_redistributions.rst:16
msgid "Viewing Route Redistributions"
msgstr "Route Redistributions anzeigen"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/route_redistributions.rst:18
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/route_redistributions.rst:26
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/route_redistributions.rst:39
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/route_redistributions.rst:49
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Network > Routers``"
msgstr "Navigieren Sie zu ``Infrastructure > Network > Routers``"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/route_redistributions.rst:19
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/route_redistributions.rst:27
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/route_redistributions.rst:40
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/route_redistributions.rst:50
